                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.00/181: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Maginnis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-09T17:00:00-04:32"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 10—10:40
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>17. Your February 4, 1 p.m. Recognition extended today at 3 p.m., by United
                    States, Argentina, Chile and Brazil.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Maginnis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
